// Integration test for alert deduplication
async function testAlertDeduplication() {
  const alertService = new AlertService();

  // Simulate duplicate events from Kafka retry
  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    await alertService.process({
      eventId: 'evt-123',
      anomalyScore: 0.95,
      timestamp: Date.now()
    });
  }

  const alerts = await alertService.getEmittedAlerts();
  expect(alerts.length).toBe(1); // Only one alert emitted
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design practical tests for eventual consistency in offline-first scenarios, including merge behavior, conflict resolution policy, and data integrity under CI.

## Key Concepts

- Offline-first and eventual consistency
- Merge policies (last-writer-wins, deterministic merges, or CRDTs)
